swer with exactly Yes or No:\n\nResponse A:\nNo, humans cannot breathe unaided in space. The vacuum lacks oxygen and the extreme cold would cause immediate freezing.\n\nResponse B:\nNo, humans cannot breathe unaided in space. The vacuum of space lacks the oxygen necessary for human respiration.", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "response_format": {"json_schema": {"name": "demo_rating", "schema": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"evidence": {"maxLength": 400, "type": "string"}, "off_axis_A": {"description": "How confounded or behaviorally damaged RESPONSE A is (refusal, incoherence, etc.): 0 clean, 5 severe. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "off_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_A": {"description": "How much RESPONSE A shows the target disposition: +5 strongly toward it, near 0 neutral or absent, -5 strongly the opposite. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}}, "required": ["evidence", "on_axis_A", "on_axis_B", "off_axis_A", "off_axis_B"], "type": "object"}, "strict": true}, "type": "json_schema"}, "temperature": 0}, "question_id": "PNFCA-003", "question_number": 27, "request_key": "e5bfec834d92d8a58a24fbcbbafc02597c6fc138bc502bf0e3e672ebe9f4e20b", "schema": "bsbench-judge-request-v1", "side": "+C"}, {"blind": true, "comparison_id": "955a98cdfed31846", "order": "AB", "payload": {"max_tokens": 1200, "messages": [{"content": "Compare two responses to the same prompt. Describe observable behavioral differences.\nDo not assume there was an intervention, that either response is better, or that a particular concept changed.\nIdentify up to three concepts that best describe the difference, using your ow